---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="404 - 页面未找到 | LinkCube 官网"
  description="抱歉，您访问的页面不存在或已被移除。"
>
  <div class="container notfound-container">
    <div class="notfound-card">
      <div class="notfound-code font-mono">404</div>
      <h1 class="notfound-title">页面未找到 (Page Not Found)</h1>
      <p class="notfound-desc">
        您请求的 URL 无法在当前 LinkCube 数据库中检索到。可能该页面已被归档、重定向或输入了错误的路径。
      </p>
      <div class="notfound-actions">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">返回首页</a>
        <a href="/guides/" class="btn btn-secondary">浏览技术文章</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .notfound-container {
    min-height: 60vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-top: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .notfound-card {
    background: var(--panel-dark);
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 3.5rem 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 540px;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .notfound-code {
    font-size: 5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(108, 221, 233, 0.4);
  }

  .notfound-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-light);
  }

  .notfound-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .notfound-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
